WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.800
Shadow, wood, sword, thunder, power, sleep

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.760
Cardcaptors of the Clow, expect the unexpected now

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.960
The secrets of the Clow, were all a mystery

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.550
But when this mighty book was opened, the powers were set free

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.690
Cardcaptors, a mystic adventure

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.630
Cardcaptors, a quest for all time

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.650
Each card possesses a power on its own

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.970
Not to find them to bring the power home

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:38.780
CHAP!

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.230
Come on, Sakura. Get up.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.110
Are you okay?

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.320
Yeah, just a little tired. That's all, Dad.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:22.950
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.660
I'm really just a little tired this morning.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:29.610
You two go ahead and go to school without me.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.840
I'll be fine. Really.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:39.950
Can I stay home from school today, Dad?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.360
Okay, but I have to go now.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.700
Right. Thanks a lot, Dad.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:11.910
I'll skip soccer practice today and come straight home, okay?

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.690
Alright, I'll come home from work early as well.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.160
I wonder what she's been up to lately.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.270
I just knew this was gonna happen.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.130
He's closer to catching on to me.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:43.140
okay listen Sakura I know why you're so tired today hey Sakura I can't even open

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:46.780
my eyes oh boy

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.010
was really busy so it took me a while

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.340
This looks so good.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.620
Got enough food there, Julian?

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.580
I hope so. I'm starving.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.440
You should have seen what I had for breakfast this morning, Tori.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:47.960
Julian?

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:52.210
Hmm?

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:58.020
I want to tell you something, but it's kind of hard to explain.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.970
I know who you...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.080
Thank you.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.250
Mm-hmm.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:30.610
I just...

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.700
Wow, Ruby is a...

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.240
Pretty good basketball player, don't you think, Tori?

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.720
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:40.720
You

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.570
feel better no kidding you feel better

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:21.460
How are you feeling?

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:22.870
Feel great.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.010
I just needed some sleep, that's all.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.250
Oh yeah, you should have heard the snoring.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:29.230
Hero!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.590
Thanks for the snacks, kid.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.750
Stop calling me kid!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.700
Just try and make me!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:38.870
Cool it, guys!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.960
Anyway, Sakura, you were saying before that you have to use another incantation now?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:51.220
The key wouldn't transform into the staff unless Sakura used the new incantation.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.360
It explains why she was so tired today.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.920
When Sakura was using her magic, a different magic circle appeared, not Klauri.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.080
It's magic circle.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:02.410
Check it out.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.220
looks different, doesn't it?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.840
Look, even the back of the card is different.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:17.600
The key finally transformed into the staff, but I still couldn't use the card.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.720
So I knew I had to change the card then as well.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.620
You mean you changed the card on your own?

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.600
Yeah, I guess I did.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.890
I would not have believed it if I didn't see it with my own eyes.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.160
Man, your powers are getting stronger, Sakura.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:33.620
Hmm?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.930
My very own star card.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.820
So what made her so tired?

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:46.290
Up until now, she's been using the Clow cards that Clow Reed created.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:50.390
Of course, she had to have magical powers in order to be able to use them.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:55.190
But Clow Reed built magical powers into the cards, so using them didn't tire her out.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:59.840
With these new cards, Sakura is using them with only her own powers.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.600
This is making her very tired.

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.840
That's why I couldn't get up this morning.

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.280
Remember when you were in trouble last night?

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:09.630
You and I couldn't do a thing to help you out.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:12.280
Don't worry about it. It turned out okay.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.900
Sakura, I have to worry about it.

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.840
It wouldn't be such a big deal.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.940
If both Yue and I were in our disguised forms...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.060
You were powerless in your original forms?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:26.940
The only one who could stop you, A&I, is Sakura, the current master.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:28.350
You

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.900
or the clow reed.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:43.870
The open what had the other night.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.890
Water funnels that came out of nowhere,

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.960
and they tracked all of us.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.780
I realized that the book and the staff had changed,

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:55.140
so maybe the cards needed to change too,

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.540
before I could use them.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.930
When I used the new incantation,

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.200
I was able to transform the Fiery card and save everyone.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:08.400
Kiro says when I transform a card, it requires a great deal of my magical powers.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.840
Another thing is, I sometimes sense a great power is present.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:11.800
wake up sakura huh you must practice a lot

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:17.860
mm-hmm you are a very good piano player thanks a lot sakura

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.310
Madison, that sure means a lot coming from you.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.580
I hear you're quite the musician.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.570
Thanks. Could you play another song, Eli?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.370
What a great idea.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:09.230
Madison and I can always go to the store another time.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.210
I'll play one of my favorites.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.140
Thank you.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:29.690
Pretty quiet lately

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.790
He wants to talk with Yui again about the other night.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:36.590
That would be a very good idea.

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:49.650
A twinkle in the night sky, far, far, golden star, gazed upon in my dreams.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:56.680
Honest voice.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.320
So I'll-

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:03.180
We can't-

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.020
Quit in here!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:04.380
Right!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:05.350
Madison!

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:06.410
Okay!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:51.520
Wee!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.890
You think it'll be okay now?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.980
Thank you.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:16.610
Dress in the wings of a dream

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.800
Twinkle in the night sky

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.300
Fa-fa-

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:33.080
Cheers!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.280
Are you ready?

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:37.300
Hmph!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.560
Here it comes!

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:18.650
Yup, our transform eye and dryer purr-

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:45.290
Goal.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:06.840
Ah!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.740
Also able to transform the song card into a star card.

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:41.860
Yeah.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.860
I don't sense that strong essence anymore.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:00.620
T-Sakura?

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:19.110
This could very interest them.
